                <mxCell id="mtrap" value="⚠ DELETE — DO NOT MIGRATE&#xa;&#xa;src/embed.ts  ·  src/intent.ts&#xa;&#xa;Phase-1 pseudocode. Undefined helpers,&#xa;dead single-vector p.vec schema,&#xa;sum-based voting, none included in margin,&#xa;NO gate layer.&#xa;&#xa;They look like the port. They are a trap." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontStyle=1;align=center;" parent="m1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="610" width="420" height="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="mnotes" value="PORTING NOTES&#xa;&#xa;· Keep BOTH asymmetries: none uses α=1.0/β=0.0 · margin skips none even when none wins&#xa;· Gates read RAW text — strip_slots removes exactly the anchors they look for&#xa;· TIME_RE is /gi and shared between stripSlots (.replace) and hasTimeAnchor (.test, advances lastIndex).&#xa;  bin/index.js:312-315 works only because it manually resets. Build TWO regex instances in the port.&#xa;· vectors.bin → Int8Array, preserving byteOffset/byteLength from a Node Buffer&#xa;· package.json: sideEffects false · exports map for &quot;.&quot; and &quot;./node&quot; · files includes artifacts/, excludes fixtures" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=15;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="m1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="830" width="540" height="190" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="mdeferred" value="DEFERRED — not blocking migration&#xa;&#xa;· time_only_anchor sub-gate  (Gate 3 treats a bare time word as strong evidence)&#xa;· typo tolerance  (exact-match lexicon → 0/12 correct PROCEED on typo variants)&#xa;· vec_full density around the anchor-bearing near-miss shape&#xa;· INTENT_VERBS audit for  set aside  and  lock in&#xa;· test.jsonl (46 rows) remains SEALED and unscored" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=15;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="m1" vertex="1">
